 "text": "Hi! How are you holding up? Pick a dry branches about the size of your arm. Roughly pile them with the pointy end up. Cotton balls work too, and they' easy find. Just light the pointy end, don't drop a match in there. Keep it small at first. A pan sized fire is all you need. Pick location well away from anything flammable and dig a small hole in the ground. Put the unlit end in, cover it with dirt, and give it a little water.",
